{"id":"d9706166a50cc2c4","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-minimization-operator.md","title":"Minimization Operator","display":"df-minimization-operator — Minimization Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-minimization-operator","aliases":["88-df-minimization-operator"],"display":"df-minimization-operator — Minimization Operator","depends_on":["[[88-df-partial-function]]","[[88-df-defined]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-minimization-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-minimization-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-minimization-operator — Minimization Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d585cbf989199162\" href=\"?note=d585cbf989199162\" title=\"88-df-partial-function\">88-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7663d6a38dbde5cc\" href=\"?note=7663d6a38dbde5cc\" title=\"88-df-defined\">88-df-defined</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (candidate arity-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(k+1)\">\\((k+1)\\)</span> partial function)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\\)</span> (partial-function predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_k(f)\">\\(\\mu_k(f)\\)</span> (candidate minimized function graph)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Defined}_f(\\vec x,z)\">\\(\\mathrm{Defined}_f(\\vec x,z)\\)</span> (defined-at predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7663d6a38dbde5cc\" href=\"?note=7663d6a38dbde5cc\" title=\"88-df-defined\">88-df-defined</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MinOp}_k(\\mu_k(f);f)\">\\(\\mathrm{MinOp}_k(\\mu_k(f);f)\\)</span> (minimization-operator predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 为候选函数图。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\vec x,z\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\vec x,z\\rangle\\)</span> 在输入位置表示向 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元组追加最后一个分量；在函数图位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\)</span> 表示输入与输出的有序对。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N\">\\(P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Least}_k(P)\">\\(\\operatorname{Least}_k(P)\\)</span> 是关系的最小见证部分函数。绑定式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu t[\\langle\\vec x,t\\rangle\\in P]\">\\(\\mu t[\\langle\\vec x,t\\rangle\\in P]\\)</span> 使用下述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Least}_k\">\\(\\operatorname{Least}_k\\)</span>。公式式写法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu t[\\theta(\\vec x,t)]\">\\(\\mu t[\\theta(\\vec x,t)]\\)</span> 先以集合分离取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\{\\langle\\vec x,t\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\\theta(\\vec x,t)\\}\">\\(P=\\{\\langle\\vec x,t\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\\theta(\\vec x,t)\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 为背景集合论公式，其他自由参数须先固定。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\quad\n\\mu_k(f)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^{k+1},\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\langle\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle,0\\rangle\\in f\n\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathbb N\\;(z&lt;y\\to\n\\exists w\\in\\mathbb N\\;(w\\neq0\\land\n\\langle\\langle\\vec x,z\\rangle,w\\rangle\\in f))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\quad\n\\mu_k(f)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^{k+1},\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\langle\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle,0\\rangle\\in f\n\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathbb N\\;(z&lt;y\\to\n\\exists w\\in\\mathbb N\\;(w\\neq0\\land\n\\langle\\langle\\vec x,z\\rangle,w\\rangle\\in f))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MinOp}_k(h;f)\\leftrightarrow\nk\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^{k+1},\\mathbb N)\n\\land h=\\mu_k(f)\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(h,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MinOp}_k(h;f)\\leftrightarrow\nk\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^{k+1},\\mathbb N)\n\\land h=\\mu_k(f)\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(h,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\quad\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^{k+1},\\mathbb N)\n\\to\\exists!h\\;\\mathrm{MinOp}_k(h;f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\quad\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^{k+1},\\mathbb N)\n\\to\\exists!h\\;\\mathrm{MinOp}_k(h;f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\forall P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\operatorname{Least}_k(P)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\vec x,t\\rangle\\in P:\n\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s&lt;t\\to\\langle\\vec x,s\\rangle\\notin P)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\forall P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\times\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\operatorname{Least}_k(P)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\vec x,t\\rangle\\in P:\n\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s&lt;t\\to\\langle\\vec x,s\\rangle\\notin P)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(\\operatorname{Least}_k(P),\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Least}_k(P))=\n\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k:\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\langle\\vec x,t\\rangle\\in P\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(\\operatorname{Least}_k(P),\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Least}_k(P))=\n\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k:\\exists t\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\langle\\vec x,t\\rangle\\in P\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mu t[\\langle\\vec x,t\\rangle\\in P]\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Least}_k(P)(\\vec x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mu t[\\langle\\vec x,t\\rangle\\in P]\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Least}_k(P)(\\vec x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>操作符寻找最小满足条件的值</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>操作符扩展原始递归到部分递归</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>操作符可能导致函数不终止</li>\n<li>候选最小值处也必须先有定义；若更小的某次计算发散，顺序搜索不能越过\n它，故结果保持未定义。这正是部分最小化而非集合论最小元。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"d585cbf989199162","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-defined","status":"resolved","id":"7663d6a38dbde5cc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-defined]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-defined","status":"resolved","id":"7663d6a38dbde5cc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Defined}_f(\\vec x,z)$ (defined-at predicate, see [[88-df-defined]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"(k+1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_k(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Defined}_f(\\vec x,z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MinOp}_k(\\mu_k(f);f)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\vec x,z\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\vec x,y\\