\\rangle\\in P\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimization\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\n\\mu t[\\langle\\vec x,t\\rangle\\in P]\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Least}_k(P)(\\vec x)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false}],"bytes":3096,"backlinks":[{"id":"402228a0530457d9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这里的$\\mu$是格论最小不动点；数论中的无界搜索由[[88-df-minimization-operator]]另行定义"},{"id":"92178dc88a5e0bd4","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MinOp}_k$ (minimization predicate, see [[88-df-minimization-operator]])"},{"id":"f29bba901d666547","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mu t[T_k(e,\\vec x,t)]$ (least $t$ satisfying $T_k$, undefined if none; see [[88-df-minimization-operator]])"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-76","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-delta.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-sigma.md]]\n[[88-df-assignment.md]]\n[[88-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-axiom.md]]\n[[88-df-bijective.md]]\n[[88-df-bound-variable.md]]\n[[88-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[88-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[88-df-cardinality.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[88-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[88-df-classical-calculus.md]]\n[[88-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[88-df-compactness.md]]\n[[88-df-completeness.md]]\n[[88-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[88-df-consistent.md]]\n[[88-df-countable.md]]\n[[88-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[88-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[88-df-defined.md]]\n[[88-df-delta0-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-delta1-set.md]]\n[[88-df-derivation.md]]\n[[88-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[88-df-effective-join.md]